BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 750 Td
(Fraud Case Handling Procedure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Apex Global Bank - Fraud Risk Management) Tj T*
(Document ID: PRC-FRD-003 | Version 3.0 | Owner: Head of Fraud Operations) Tj T*
(Illustrative policy for the Finova demo workspace. Not legal or regulatory advice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This procedure explains how fraud alerts raised by the surveillance engine or reported by) Tj T*
(customers are triaged, investigated and resolved.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Case Statuses) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Flagged: raised by a surveillance rule; awaiting triage.) Tj T*
(- In Review: assigned to an investigator.) Tj T*
(- Frozen Escrow: funds held because the risk score is 80 or above, or an investigator ordered a) Tj T*
(hold.) Tj T*
(- Cleared: investigated and confirmed legitimate; any hold is released.) Tj T*
(- Confirmed Fraud: fraud established; recovery and reporting begin.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Risk Tiers) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Critical \(risk score 80 to 100\): auto-freeze debits, triage within 1 hour.) Tj T*
(- High \(risk score 50 to 79\): triage within 4 hours.) Tj T*
(- Nominal \(below 50\): triage within 24 hours; may be batch-reviewed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Investigation Steps) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Review the triggering rule, transaction pattern, device and location data.) Tj T*
(2. Contact the customer through the registered phone number only, never through contact details) Tj T*
(in the suspicious transaction.) Tj T*
(3. Decide Cleared or Confirmed Fraud and record the rationale.) Tj T*
(4. For Confirmed Fraud: block the card or channel, raise a recall request with the beneficiary) Tj T*
(bank, and file a police complaint where the loss is INR 1,00,000 or more.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Customer-Reported Fraud) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- A customer reporting an unauthorised transaction within 3 working days bears zero liability) Tj T*
(once the claim is validated.) Tj T*
(- Reports made between 4 and 7 working days: customer liability is capped at INR 25,000.) Tj T*
(- The bank credits the disputed amount \(shadow credit\) within 10 working days of the report) Tj T*
(while the investigation continues.) Tj T*
(- Final resolution must be completed within 90 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Escalation to AML) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Any fraud case that also shows money-laundering indicators \(structuring, mule accounts, rapid) Tj T*
(pass-through\) is referred to AML Investigations under POL-AML-002.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Roles and Responsibilities) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Finance Analyst: triage and investigation.) Tj T*
(- Support Executive: records customer reports and gives status updates without disclosing) Tj T*
(investigation details.) Tj T*
(- Admin: monitors queue SLAs and approves freezes longer than 7 days.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
