(6. Roles and Responsibilities) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Support Executive: collects documents and explains requirements to the customer.) Tj T*
(- Onboarding Officer: verifies documents and assigns the risk tier.) Tj T*
(- Compliance: approves high-risk customers and enhanced due diligence.) Tj T*
ET
