BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 750 Td
(Customer Support SLA and Complaint Handling) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Apex Global Bank - Customer Service) Tj T*
(Document ID: PRC-SUP-005 | Version 2.2 | Owner: Head of Customer Experience) Tj T*
(Illustrative policy for the Finova demo workspace. Not legal or regulatory advice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This procedure sets response and resolution targets for customer support tickets and the) Tj T*
(escalation path for complaints.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Ticket Priorities and SLA Targets) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Priority - Examples - First response - Resolution target) Tj T*
(Urgent - Card fraud, account blocked, failed salary credit - 15 minutes - 4 hours) Tj T*
(High - Failed transfer, wrong debit, KYC rejection - 1 hour - 24 hours) Tj T*
(Medium - Statement request, limit change, address update - 4 hours - 3 business days) Tj T*
(Low - General inquiry, product information - 1 business day - 5 business days) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The default SLA target for an unclassified ticket is 4 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Ticket Statuses) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Open: received, not yet picked up.) Tj T*
(- In Progress: assigned to a support executive.) Tj T*
(- Pending Client: waiting for information from the customer. The SLA clock pauses in this) Tj T*
(status.) Tj T*
(- Resolved: solution provided; customer has 7 days to reopen.) Tj T*
(- Closed: resolved and confirmed, or auto-closed after 7 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Escalation Matrix) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Level 1 - Support Executive: handles the ticket.) Tj T*
(2. Level 2 - Team Lead: takes over automatically if the resolution target is breached.) Tj T*
(3. Level 3 - Nodal Officer: handles complaints unresolved after 15 days or escalated by the) Tj T*
(customer.) Tj T*
(4. If the complaint is not resolved within 30 days, the customer may approach the Banking) Tj T*
(Ombudsman.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Customer Satisfaction \(CSAT\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(After every resolved ticket the customer is invited to rate the service from 1 to 5. A rating) Tj T*
(of 2 or below triggers a callback from a Team Lead within 2 business days. The CSAT target is) Tj T*
(an average of 4.2 or higher.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Service Conduct) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Always verify identity before discussing account details.) Tj T*
(- Never ask for full card numbers, PINs, CVV or OTPs.) Tj T*
(- Never disclose fraud or AML investigation details; use "Your transaction is under routine) Tj T*
(review.") Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
